<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of January 13 to January 17, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreign investors had been net buyers since the week starting December 30, 1996.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p> Total foreign buying	   630.16 billion yen</p>
<p> Total foreign selling	  637.82 billion yen</p>
<p> Net selling			  7.66 billion yen</p>
<p> Previous week net buying	37.98 billion yen</p>
